{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>看病或覆診時，往往會忘記原本想問的問題，藥物紀錄、轉介信、檢查報告與收據也容易散落各處。Visit Admission Notes 讓你集中整理想說的話、想問的問題、正在服用的藥物，以及需要帶備的物品，並可為自己與家人分別建立紀錄。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合需要定期覆診、陪伴家人就醫或準備住院的人士。</p>\n\n<h2>整理覆診資料與住院清單</h2>\n<p>可記錄每次覆診的日期、醫生、部門與跟進安排，整理想提出的疑問，並建立用藥清單，存放藥物手冊、轉介信、檢查報告與收據照片。住院前可用行李清單逐項準備。家庭成員的紀錄分開保存，並可產生 PDF 摘要、匯出 CSV 及以 ZIP 備份，另設本機提醒與密碼鎖定。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-756-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-757-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-758-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-759-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-760-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-761-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Visit Admission Notes</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T22:39:32.721297+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":356,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}